@deralmas Ah that figures. The person on reddit who commented (also had a contributor badge) sort of made it sound like this was ready to and just needed the status change to be merged. I should've known better, lol!

I'll definitely check out building the templates manually, as it doesn't seem too difficult. That should hold me over. I suppose I can just do a git pull and get all the latest stuff as well, so I'll also give that a shot! I'll report back if I find any other bugs/issues and then can keep up with the newest things.

Hope the studies go well and everything else goes better. You're the Godot savior for all things Linux!

@mahkoh That's wonderful! Thank you for letting me know, I'll check it out. It sounds very nifty, especially with all the utilities you built around it.

> Just wanted to let you know that I thought this was pretty neat.

Thank you, I'm really glad :D
